  "slug": "old-fashioned-flaky-pie-crust",
  "name": "Old Fashioned Flaky Pie Crust",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "An old recipe for pie crust uses only 4 ingredients, including vegetable oil, to make a flaky pie crust that works for either savory or sweet fillings.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Whisk flour and salt together in a large bowl. Stir in oil with a fork until evenly mixed. Add water, 1 tablespoon at a time, mixing well after each addition. Gather dough into a ball, divide in half, and roll out on a floured work surface."
    }
  ],
